
## Optimal

```python
class Solution:
    def resultArray(self, nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:
        arr1 = [nums[0]]
        arr2 = [nums[1]]

        for num in nums[2:]:
            if arr1[-1] > arr2[-1]:
                arr1.append(num)
            else:
                arr2.append(num)

        return arr1 + arr2
```

**TC:** O(n)
**SC:** O(n)

